      "SciSciNet atypicality 2x2 (hit = top 5% C10 in FoS x year) -> hit prob per cell: {'LowConv|LowNov': 0.0294, 'LowConv|HighNov': 0.0487, 'HighConv|LowNov': 0.0515, 'HighConv|HighNov': 0.0677}\n",
      "CPU times: user 20 s, sys: 4.75 s, total: 24.8 s\n",
